  "summary": "The Yomut carpet is a type of Turkmen rug traditionally handwoven by the Yomut or Yomud, one of the five major tribes of Turkmenistan.",
  "description": "The Yomut carpet is a type of Turkmen rug traditionally handwoven by the Yomut or Yomud, one of the five major tribes of Turkmenistan. A Yomut design, along with designs from the other major tribes, is featured on the coat of arms and the flag of Turkmenistan.",
